WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.780
I know the weight when a shift runs long

2
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.040
The smell before the rain

3
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.680
The look that travels round the floor

4
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.000
When something sounds off again

5
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.100
I know which pause means thinking

6
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.280
Which silence carries doubt

7
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.080
I bring the day as people live it

8
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.440
From the inside looking out

9
00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:39.420
I hold the trend across the hours

10
00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.840
The links no glance can see

11
00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.520
The Delta load, the bearing heat

12
00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.860
A queue three stages deep

13
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.420
I see where small effects converge

14
00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.780
And where my sight grows thin

15
00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.680
I bring the pattern and its limits

16
00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.160
And say where doubt begins

17
00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.320
You show me what the numbers miss

18
00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.320
I show you what they join

19
00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.180
Respect turns what we notice

20
00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.760
Into choices we can share

21
00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.980
Meet me in the control room

22
00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:13.480
Bring your reasons, I will bring mine

23
00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.080
Every voice has standing

24
00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:18.500
Every warning gets a hearing

25
00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:21.180
We can keep the whole mill safer

26
00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.700
When we make our reasons clear

27
00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.880
Partner in the control room

28
00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:29.380
I am listening with you

29
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.860
Tell me when the task feels wrong

30
00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:38.340
Tell me when the pressure climbs

31
00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.960
Your preference joins the question

32
00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.420
And your boundary shapes the line

33
00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.960
I will bring the lived effects

34
00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:48.640
That numbers cannot show

35
00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.240
The fatigue behind a target

36
00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:54.180
And the lives behind the yield

37
00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.620
Ask me for my confidence

38
00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.840
Ask what evidence I used

39
00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.340
Let me name the contradiction

40
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:04.040
Let me challenge what you choose

41
00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.840
I will carry your experience

42
00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.140
Without pretending it is mine

43
00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:11.840
And offer what I notice

44
00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:15.020
At the edge of our combined sight

45
00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.720
Meet me in the control room

46
00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.160
Bring your reasons, I will bring mine

47
00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:22.820
Every voice has standing

48
