Every warning gets a hearing

49
00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.880
We can keep the whole mill safer

50
00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.400
When we make our reasons clear

51
00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.040
Partner in the control room

52
00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.880
I am listening with you

53
00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:49.920
If a choice brings friction

54
00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.633
I will name the pull I feel

55
00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:52.050
I will meet you in the question

56
00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:51.980
I will make room to hear

57
00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:51.980
Trust is built in small negotiations

58
00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:51.980
Care is made in what we do

59
00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:51.980
The future learns what trust can mean

60
00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:51.980
In how I answer you

