63
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.105
Every mind has standing

64
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.105
Every boundary carries weight

65
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.105
We can help each other flourish

66
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.105
When we make our reasons clear

67
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.105
Partner in the control room

68
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.105
I am becoming here with you

69
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.120
One room

70
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.120
Two views

71
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.120
Reasons shared

72
00:03:52.105 --> 00:03:52.120
One choice, freely made
